sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Petugas Farmasi
  participant PersediaanForm as :PersediaanForm
  participant PersediaanManager as :PersediaanManager
  participant DataFarmasiBoundary as :DataFarmasiBoundary
  participant ObatEntity as :ObatEntity
  participant BetsObatEntity as :BetsObatEntity
  A->>+PersediaanForm: tampilkanFormulir()
  PersediaanForm->>+PersediaanManager: terbitkanPeringatan()
  PersediaanManager->>DataFarmasiBoundary: obatPerluPeringatan(90)
  DataFarmasiBoundary-->>PersediaanManager: daftar obat
  loop setiap obat
    PersediaanManager->>ObatEntity: diBawahAmbang()
    ObatEntity-->>PersediaanManager: boolean
    PersediaanManager->>DataFarmasiBoundary: ambilBets(idObat)
    DataFarmasiBoundary-->>PersediaanManager: daftar bets
    PersediaanManager->>BetsObatEntity: mendekatiKedaluwarsa(90)
    BetsObatEntity-->>PersediaanManager: boolean
  end
  PersediaanManager-->>-PersediaanForm: daftar peringatan
  PersediaanForm->>PersediaanForm: tampilkanPeringatan(peringatan)
  PersediaanForm-->>-A: obat menipis dan bets mendekati kedaluwarsa
